            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Xoi Mo Su Su",
            "review_text": "Baylane61\nHuntington Beach, California421 contributions\n0\nHidden local chicken restaurant\nDec 2023 • Friends\nMy brother took us to this tiny restaurant in an alley. It is a small but air conditioned restaurant. We only needed to wait for 10 minutes even though the restaurant was busy. We got 2 tables for 10 people. The chicken rice was excellent. The chicken was crispy. The sauce was very awesome. My sister in laws ordered five extra side chicken dishes.\n\nThe price was so reasonable. The services were good and fast.\n\nI highly recommended this chicken place. We definitely come back again next time we are in Saigon!!!\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2023",
