            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Xoi Mo Su Su",
            "review_text": "Jessica T\nHong Kong, China4 contributions\n0\nGreat chicken dinner!\nApr 2023 • Couples\nMy husband and I read about this 'waterfall chicken' spot on a food blog and we're so happy we added it to our HCM 'must trys'. We ordered the com ga canh and com ga dui - both so delicious that we ended up ordering the \nextra side chicken. The sauce that comes on the side is also fantastic! The staff were friendly and welcoming. If you like chicken, be sure to try this HCM gem!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 3, 2023",
