            "review_text": "Michael G\n9 contributions\n0\nIf you love fried chicken, this is your healthiest version!\nJul 2022 • Couples\nFirst time I've seen a waterfall frying machine before, but the results were amazing...no batter involved, just hot oil dripped over seasoned raw chicken and skin for crispy and delicious and juicy fried chicken! Make sure to dip in the secret sause! It is hidden on a side alley in the middle of nowhere, but a must try if you are visiting Saigon.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2022",
