            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Xoi Mo Su Su",
            "review_text": "Greggggg123\n155 contributions\n0\nBest fried chicken ever\nApr 2022 • Couples\nBest fried chicken ever. Without a doubt, the crispiest and most flavoursome fried chicken I’ve ever had in my life. The gentleman that owns this place has invented the machine that works the magic. The chicken is placed on a shelf and boiling hot oil is ‘waterfalled’ over the chicken. This method means that the chicken isn’t heavy with oil, and the skin maintains a perfect crispiness while remaining juicy and tasty. The rice and soy bean paste that accompanies the chicken is worth the trip alone. We went twice and would’ve gone a third time if we had have had more time. It’s a short walk from one end of the Walking Street. Make the effort and you shall be rewarded!\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
