            "review_text": "inatree29\nMelbourne, Australia25 contributions\n0\nWorth the trip to district 3\nNov 2018\nNext to nothing service but omg the chicken! Delicious. Good serving sizes. Waterfall fryer looked to be a great invention. Store front may be hard to find but just put in the address and your grab driver will stop right out front (addresses don’t seem to always work this way in Vietnam.. weird)\n\n42k for a decent serving size and and great meal. Honest staff who try to give you exact change even when you want them to keep it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 20, 2018",
